        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/703ea7f54be65a1b5f51ed08a97dd2cd.avif?t=1754706164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras_big/703ea7f54be65a1b5f51ed08a97dd2cd.avif?t=1754706164 width=800 height=139 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Buddy</strong> and <strong>Bag Boy</strong> - two tiny robots with big hearts and an even bigger mission: spreading joy wherever they go! After a mysterious explosion rains golden cogs and trash from the sky, the duo must work together to restore each village and uncover the secret behind the blast.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/2bb2f3d41a693657387d3476953411ce.avif?t=1754706164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras_big/2bb2f3d41a693657387d3476953411ce.avif?t=1754706164 width=800 height=272 /></span>Scrub messes, collect trash, and lend a helping hand by cleaning up. Every difference you make earns you points. Got trash? Recycle it at any RECYC0TRON for extra cash to spend in stores during your adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/26e028943d8a2acce69c7481407ee86a.avif?t=1754706164\" width=783 height=409 /></span>Being this tiny has its perks too! Squeeze through tight nooks and explore a playground built from everyday objects. Dash across rulers, leap over cups, and crouch under old milk cartons. This unique perspective lets you experience the world in a whole new way.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1721617d1f11a74d98581eac5a8a8bec.avif?t=1754706164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras_big/1721617d1f11a74d98581eac5a8a8bec.avif?t=1754706164 width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the surface lies a touching tale that deepens as you meet new bots. From UFOs and secret lovers to unlikely heroes and dancing instruments, you’ll discover a world full of quirky characters with stories worth hearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1cee1fca8b52e6b7b18766b2d7478ff4.poster.avif?t=1754706164\" width=590 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1cee1fca8b52e6b7b18766b2d7478ff4.webm?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1cee1fca8b52e6b7b18766b2d7478ff4.mp4?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through backyards, playgrounds, and forgotten lands in a mysterious post-human world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, repair, and make a meaningful difference as you tidy each village.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with unique robots made from everyday items, helping them with their struggles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find golden cogs, coins, and hidden treasures tucked away in every nook and cranny.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt narrative that mixes humor with real emotion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/35160ae883499202426fff3a8c4530d7.poster.avif?t=1754706164\" width=590 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/35160ae883499202426fff3a8c4530d7.webm?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/35160ae883499202426fff3a8c4530d7.mp4?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being <i>small</i> never felt so <i><strong>BIG</strong></i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/703ea7f54be65a1b5f51ed08a97dd2cd.avif?t=1754706164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras_big/703ea7f54be65a1b5f51ed08a97dd2cd.avif?t=1754706164 width=800 height=139 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Buddy</strong> and <strong>Bag Boy</strong> - two tiny robots with big hearts and an even bigger mission: spreading joy wherever they go! After a mysterious explosion rains golden cogs and trash from the sky, the duo must work together to restore each village and uncover the secret behind the blast.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/2bb2f3d41a693657387d3476953411ce.avif?t=1754706164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras_big/2bb2f3d41a693657387d3476953411ce.avif?t=1754706164 width=800 height=272 /></span>Scrub messes, collect trash, and lend a helping hand by cleaning up. Every difference you make earns you points. Got trash? Recycle it at any RECYC0TRON for extra cash to spend in stores during your adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/26e028943d8a2acce69c7481407ee86a.avif?t=1754706164\" width=783 height=409 /></span>Being this tiny has its perks too! Squeeze through tight nooks and explore a playground built from everyday objects. Dash across rulers, leap over cups, and crouch under old milk cartons. This unique perspective lets you experience the world in a whole new way.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1721617d1f11a74d98581eac5a8a8bec.avif?t=1754706164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras_big/1721617d1f11a74d98581eac5a8a8bec.avif?t=1754706164 width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the surface lies a touching tale that deepens as you meet new bots. From UFOs and secret lovers to unlikely heroes and dancing instruments, you’ll discover a world full of quirky characters with stories worth hearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1cee1fca8b52e6b7b18766b2d7478ff4.poster.avif?t=1754706164\" width=590 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1cee1fca8b52e6b7b18766b2d7478ff4.webm?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/1cee1fca8b52e6b7b18766b2d7478ff4.mp4?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through backyards, playgrounds, and forgotten lands in a mysterious post-human world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, repair, and make a meaningful difference as you tidy each village.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with unique robots made from everyday items, helping them with their struggles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find golden cogs, coins, and hidden treasures tucked away in every nook and cranny.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt narrative that mixes humor with real emotion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/35160ae883499202426fff3a8c4530d7.poster.avif?t=1754706164\" width=590 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/35160ae883499202426fff3a8c4530d7.webm?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308940/extras/35160ae883499202426fff3a8c4530d7.mp4?t=1754706164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being <i>small</i> never felt so <i><strong>BIG</strong></i></p>",
